- name: signpost
  type: table
  desc: Functions for marking points of interest in Xcode Instruments using signposts (iOS/macOS only).

  members:

  - name: start
    type: function
    desc: Start a signpost interval and return its identifier.

    parameters:
    - name: scope_name
      type: string
      desc: Name shown in Instruments for the interval.

    returns:
    - name: id
      type: number
      desc: Signpost identifier to pass to `signpost.stop`.

    examples:
      - desc: |-
                 ```lua
                 local id = signpost.start("loading")
                 -- do work
                 signpost.stop(id, "done")
                 ```

  - name: stop
    type: function
    desc: End a signpost interval started with `signpost.start`.

    parameters:
    - name: id
      type: number
      desc: Identifier returned by `signpost.start`.

    - name: info
      type: string
      optional: true
      desc: Optional info string shown in Instruments when the interval ends.

  - name: event
    type: function
    desc: Emit a point-in-time signpost event.

    parameters:
    - name: info
      type: string
      desc: Event info string shown in Instruments.
